Package: urbackup-pve
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: libpve-storage-perl (>= 9.0), pve-container, qemu-server, util-linux (>= 2.39)
Maintainer: LJ <ljlongwing@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://www.urbackup.org
Description: UrBackup backup provider for Proxmox VE
 Backs up the virtual machines and containers of Proxmox VE with UrBackup, as a
 storage of type "urbackup" that backup jobs can use. The UrBackup client on
 the host does the backups; it is not part of this package.
